{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress in the rich tones of fall!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This stylish set includes autumn-themed outfits, cozy hats, and a warm hair dye color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available at Matsuri and Kagari on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for enjoying the cool air and colorful leaves in Elnea Kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC includes the following items:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbOutfits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available at Matsuri Apparel on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Floral Town-Wear: Brown, Floral Town Kid: Brown, Floral Town-Wear: Twilight, Floral Town Kid: Twilight, Patchwork Wear: Autumn, Kid's Patch-Wear: Autumn, Ancestral Garb: Violet, Child's Ancestral Garb: Violet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbEquipment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available at Kagari Accouterments on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rose Straw Hat: Violet, Pom Casquette: Autumn</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbDyes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available at Kagari Accouterments on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Violet Hair Dye</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b This content can only be purchased once per account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b If you uninstall the DLC after saving, that save data will no longer be loadable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b The base game (sold separately) is required to use this content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please ensure your game is updated to the latest version if necessary.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3828670?t=1757473043","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3828670?t=1757473043","